    {
      "source": "Visits a method of the class. This method <i>must</i> return a new <a href=\"../../asm/MethodVisitor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.asm\"><code>MethodVisitor</code></a>\ninstance (or null) each time it is called, i.e., it should not return a previously\nreturned visitor.",
      "translation": "访问类的某个方法。该方法每次被调用时<i>必须</i>返回一个新的<a href=\"../../asm/MethodVisitor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.asm\"><code>MethodVisitor</code></a>实例（或 null），即不应返回之前已返回的 visitor。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Visits a method of the class.",
      "translation": "访问类的某个方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"AbstractClassTransformer.html#setTarget(org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor)\">setTarget</a></code> in class <code><a href=\"AbstractClassTransformer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.cglib.transform\">AbstractClassTransformer</a></code>",
