    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html#toString()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">toString</a></code> in class <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Object</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html#toString()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">toString</a></code>` 在类 `<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Object</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>access</code> - the method's access flags (see <a href=\"../../asm/Opcodes.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.asm\"><code>Opcodes</code></a>). This parameter also indicates if\n    the method is synthetic and/or deprecated.",
      "translation": "`<code>access</code>` - 方法的访问标志（参见<a href=\"../../asm/Opcodes.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.asm\"><code>Opcodes</code></a>）。此参数还指示方法是否为合成方法和/或已过时。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>desc</code> - the method's descriptor (see <a href=\"../../asm/Type.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.asm\"><code>Type</code></a>).",
      "translation": "<code>desc</code> - 方法的描述符（参见<a href=\"../../asm/Type.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.asm\"><code>Type</code></a>）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>exceptions</code> - the internal names of the method's exception classes (see <a href=\"../../asm/Type.html#getInternalName()\"><code>Type.getInternalName()</code></a>). May be null.",
      "translation": "`exceptions` - 方法的异常类的内部名称（参见<a href=\"../../asm/Type.html#getInternalName()\"><code>Type.getInternalName()</code></a>）。可为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>name</code> - the method's name.",
      "translation": "<code>name</code> - 方法名。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>signature</code> - the method's signature. May be null if the method parameters,\n    return type and exceptions do not use generic types.",
      "translation": "<code>signature</code> - 方法的签名。如果方法参数、返回类型和异常不使用泛型，则可能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "an object to visit the byte code of the method, or null if this class\n    visitor is not interested in visiting the code of this method.",
      "translation": "一个用于访问该方法的字节码的对象，如果该类访问者不感兴趣访问该方法的代码，则为 null。",
      "count": 1
